<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"/><meta name="description" content="Games, developer tools, web and mobile projects by Muhammad Usman Butt."/><link rel="canonical" href="https://usmanbutt.dev/projects/"/><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg"/><title>Project index · Muhammad Usman Butt</title></head><body><a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a><header class="masthead"><a class="wordmark" href="/">ub<span>↗</span></a><a href="mailto:buttu7666@gmail.com">Say hello ↗</a></header><main id="main" class="wrap"><div class="index-header"><a href="/">← Back to the story</a><h1>The project index<span class="blue">.</span></h1><p>A collection of tools, games, applications, and small experiments.</p></div><div class="project-index">{work.map(([repo,name,description])=><article class="index-row"><h2>{name}</h2><div><p>{description}</p>{vibeCoded.has(repo) && <p class="build-method"><span>Vibe-coded</span> <strong>Human-designed, AI-implemented</strong></p>}</div><a href={'https://github.com/usmanbutt-dev/'+repo}>Repository ↗</a></article>)}<h2>Selected freelance work</h2><p class="caption">High-level summaries. Client details and source code are private.</p>{clientWork.map(([name,description])=><article class="index-row"><h2>{name}</h2><p>{description}</p><span class="caption">Client work</span></article>)}</div></main><footer class="wrap footer"><span>© 2026 Muhammad Usman Butt</span><a href="mailto:buttu7666@gmail.com">Contact ↗</a></footer></body></html>
